ds.\nHoodwink is knocked backwards for a distance of %recoil_distance% from the force of the shot. Creeps hit by the bolt are damaged for half the values.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"scepter": {"zh": "提升箭矢速度和减速效果。", "en": "Increases arrow speed and movement speed slow."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["arrow_speed", "arrow_width", "arrow_range", "arrow_vision", "max_charge_time", "max_damage", "recoil_distance", "recoil_height", "recoil_duration", "max_slow_debuff_duration", "misfire_time", "slow_move_pct", "turn_rate", "turn_rate_tooltip", "vision_along_indicator"]}, {"subject": "dawnbreaker_fire_wreath", "name_zh": "破晓辰星·星破天惊", "name_en": "Starbreaker", "description_zh": "破晓辰星将她的战锤旋转3次，对敌人造成攻击伤害以及额外伤害。最后一次打击时，她将战锤击向地面，对她前方的敌人造成眩晕和伤害。", "description_en": "Dawnbreaker whirls her hammer around 3 times, damaging enemies with her attack plus bonus damage. On the final strike, she smashes her hammer down, stunning and damaging enemies in front of her.", "notes_zh": ["破晓辰星在技能持续时间内以%movement_speed%的移动速度行进，并且最后一击后需要%self_stun_duration%秒才能复原。", "连击期间无法施放上界重锤或天光现世。", "此技能不继承分裂效果。", "可以对自身施放来向前移动。", "前两次挥击会减少敌人%swipe_slow%%%移动速度，持续%sweep_stun_duration%秒。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"shard": {"zh": "破晓辰星在星破天惊期间获得减益免疫，%immunity_resist%%%魔法抗性加成和自由移动状态。破晓辰星会被减速%shard_movement_penalty%%%，移速最低为%movement_speed%。", "en": "Dawnbreaker gains debuff immunity with %immunity_resist%%% magic resistance and free movement during Starbreaker. Dawnbreaker is slowed by %shard_movement_penalty%%% down to a minimum of %movement_speed%."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["duration", "swipe_radius", "swipe_damage", "smash_radius", "smash_damage", "movement_speed", "total_attacks", "smash_stun_duration", "sweep_stun_duration", "self_stun_duration", "swipe_slow", "smash_distance_from_hero", "turn_rate", "shard_cast_point", "shard_movement_penalty"]}, {"subject": "dawnbreaker_celestial_hammer", "name_zh": "破晓辰星·上界重锤", "name_en": "Celestial Hammer", "description_zh": "破晓辰星向一个目标扔出她的武器，对沿途的敌人造成伤害。战锤会在目的地停留%pause_duration%秒，再飞回她的手中，期间留下一道炽烈之径，减缓敌人的移动速度。破晓辰星可以随时召回战锤，将自身朝战锤牵引，使二者在中点相遇。", "description_en": "Dawnbreaker hurls her weapon at a target, damaging enemies struck along the way. The hammer pauses for %pause_duration% seconds at the destination before flying back to her, leaving a trail of fire that slows enemies. Dawnbreaker can recall the hammer at any time, pulling her towards it so they meet in the middle.", "notes_zh": ["战锤在飞出和飞回时都会对敌人造成伤害。", "破晓辰星的会合移动距离不会超过技能的施法距离。", "星破天惊无法在战锤脱手时施放。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["hammer_damage", "projectile_radius", "projectile_speed", "flare_debuff_duration", "flare_radius", "move_slow", "targets_allies", "burn_damage", "burn_interval", "pause_duration", "hammer_aoe_radius", "travel_speed_pct", "return_anim_distance_threshold", "range", "hammer_solar_guardian_radius"]}, {"subject": "dawnbreaker_solar_guardian", "name_zh": "破晓辰星·天光现世", "name_en": "Solar Guardian", "description_zh": "持续施法 - 破晓辰星在地图上任意友方英雄%max_offset_distance%距离内的一个地点创造一个脉冲效果，并制造持续%daytime_duration%秒的白天。每次脉冲都会对敌人造成伤害，并治疗友军。经过一段短暂时间后，她飞向目标地点，落地时造成额外伤害并眩晕敌人。开始持续施法后，破晓辰星无法中止此技能。", "description_en": "CHANNELED - Dawnbreaker creates a pulsing effect at a location within %max_offset_distance% units of an allied hero anywhere on the map and creates daylight for %daytime_duration%s. Each pulse damages enemies and heals allies.After a short duration, she flies to the target location and deals additional damage and stuns enemies upon landing.Once channeled, Dawnbreaker cannot stop the ability.", "notes_zh": ["脉冲间隔为%pulse_interval%秒。", "总飞行时间为%abilitychanneltime%秒持续施法时间 + %airtime_duration%秒飞行时间。", "施放时立刻召回战锤。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"scepter": {"zh": "天光现世的光环在破晓辰星落地后会跟随%scepter_aura_duration%秒。", "en": "Solar Guardian's aura follows Dawnbreaker for %scepter_aura_duration%s after landing."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["scepter_aura_duration", "miss_rate", "base_heal", "radius", "base_damage", "pulse_interval", "land_damage", "land_stun_duration", "max_offset_distance", "scepter_channel_time", "airtime_scepter_bonus", "airtime_scepter_movement_speed", "airtime_duration", "daytime_duration", "AbilityChannelTime"]}, {"subject": "marci_companion_run", "name_zh": "玛西·回身踢", "name_en": "Rebound", "description_zh": "玛西跃向友方目标单位，选好她要弹离的方向和距离。到达目标后玛西冲向最终的目的地，对落地点的敌人造成伤害和眩晕。\n\n回身踢设为多样施法（右键点击技能栏图标）后，玛西会把她的友军目标带向最终目的地。\n\n友军将获得%ally_movespeed_pct%%%移动速度加成，持续%ally_buff_duration%秒。", "description_en": "Marci bounds to the targeted allied unit, choosing a direction and distance she will spring away from it. Upon reaching the unit, Marci lunges to her final destination, damaging and stunning enemies where she lands.\n\nWhen Rebound is set to alt-cast, Marci brings the target ally with her to her final destination.\n\n The ally receives %ally_movespeed_pct%%% bonus movement speed for %ally_buff_duration%s.", "notes_zh": ["玛西冲刺时目标单位可以躲避该效果。", "不会触发法术反弹。", "多样施法时不会带走被缠绕或束缚的友军。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"shard": {"zh": "提升伤害。回身踢可以对敌人施放，并且玛西施放后自身也会获得加速效果。", "en": "Increases damage. Rebound can be cast on enemies, and causes Marci to also get the speed boost when she casts it."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["move_speed", "max_jump_distance", "landing_radius", "impact_damage", "debuff_duration", "min_lob_travel_time", "max_lob_travel_time", "min_height_above_lowest", "min_height_above_highest", "min_acceleration", "max_acceleration", "vector_preview_radius", "ally_buff_duration", "ally_movespeed_pct", "impact_position_offset"]}, {"subject": "primal_beast_onslaught", "name_zh": "獸·突", "name_en": "Onslaught", "description_zh": "獸积蓄力量再向选定方向冲去，将敌人和队友同时击退。敌方单位被撞时受到伤害，并且被眩晕。蓄力时间越长，獸冲的距离越远。\n\n可以随时使用停止指令来中止。", "description_en": "Primal Beast charges up and then runs in the chosen direction, knocking back enemies and allies alike. Enemy units are damaged and stunned on impact. The longer the charge duration, the farther Primal Beast's momentum will carry him. \n\n Can be cancelled at any time with the Stop command.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["charge_speed", "chargeup_time", "knockback_radius", "max_distance", "knockback_distance", "knockback_damage", "knockback_duration", "max_charge_time", "turn_rate", "base_power", "movement_turn_rate", "stun_duration", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "ringmaster_whoopee_cushion", "name_zh": "百戏大王·整蛊垫", "name_en": "Whoopee Cushion", "description_zh": "使用：噗把英雄向前推动%leap_distance%距离。在身后留下一团%fart_cloud_radius%范围的臭云，持续%fart_cloud_duration%秒，使敌人减速%fart_cloud_slow%%%。", "description_en": "Use: WhoopsiePropels your hero forward %leap_distance% units. Leaves a %fart_cloud_radius% radius stink cloud behind for %fart_cloud_duration% seconds that slows enemies by %fart_cloud_slow%%%.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["leap_distance", "leap_speed", "leap_acceleration", "fart_cloud_duration", "fart_cloud_slow", "fart_cloud_aura_linger_duration", "fart_cloud_radius", "AbilityCharges", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "kez_grappling_claw", "name_zh": "凯·制敌爪钩", "name_en": "Grappling Claw", "description_zh": "凯向目标单位或者树木发射一枚抓钩并摆荡过去。抓钩碰到目标后，该单位会被减速。凯到达敌方目标时，落地会发动一次攻击。", "description_en": "Kez swings on a grappling hook towards the target unit or tree.  When the grappling hook collides with the target, that unit has slowed movement speed. Upon reaching the enemy target, Kez lands an attack on them.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["land_distance", "projectile_speed", "grapple_speed", "max_distance_break", "debuff_duration", "katana_ms_slow_pct", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "kez_falcon_rush", "name_zh": "凯·天隼冲击", "name_en": "Falcon Rush", "description_zh": "开启后凯可以向敌方目标冲去，发动的攻击会重复一次。在这个状态下，凯拥有相位移动状态和减速抗性。", "description_en": "Kez gains the ability to rush towards enemy targets to deliver echoing secondary attacks.  While in this state, Kez has phased collision and slow resistance.", "notes_zh": ["不会对建筑生效。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["rush_range", "rush_speed", "base_echo_damage", "slow_resist", "duration", "break_range", "bonus_attack_speed", "echo_proc_chance_reduction", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "arcane_blink", "name_zh": "秘奥闪光", "name_en": "Arcane Blink", "description_en": "Active: Arcane Blink  Teleport to a target point up to %blink_range% units away.   After teleportation, you restore %heal_amount% health and %mana_amount% mana.  Arcane Blink cannot be used for %blink_damage_cooldown% seconds after taking damage from an enemy hero or Roshan.", "notes_en": ["Self-casting will cause you to teleport in the direction of your team's fountain."], "attributes": ["+ 25 Intelligence"], "is_item": true}, {"subject": "blink", "name_zh": "闪烁匕首", "name_en": "Blink Dagger", "description_en": "Active: Blink  Teleport to a target point up to %blink_range% units away.   Blink Dagger cannot be used for %blink_damage_cooldown% seconds after taking damage from an enemy hero or Roshan.", "notes_en": ["Self-casting will cause you to teleport in the direction of your team's fountain."], "attributes": [], "is_item": true}, {"subject": "force_staff", "name_zh": "原力法杖", "name_en": "Force Staff", "description_en": "Active: Force Pushes any target unit %push_length% units in the direction it is facing.", "notes_en": ["Self-cast will cause you to use Force on yourself.", "Force Staff doesn't interrupt the target's actions.", "Will not work on a unit inside Chronosphere, Duel, or Black Hole.", "Force Staff has %enemy_cast_range% cast range when cast on enemies."], "attributes": ["+ 10 Intelligence", "+ 175 Health"], "is_item": true}, {"subject": "harpoon", "name_zh": "鱼叉", "name_en": "Harpoon", "description_en": "Active: Draw Forth  When targeting an enemy, fire a harpoon at them, that pulls you and the target closer together, up to %pull_distance_pct%%% of the distance between you and your target. If the caster is melee, the hero and target are always pulled to within melee distance of each other. Targeting a tree always pulls you all the way to that tree.   Passive: Echo Strike  Causes melee attacks to attack twice in quick succession. The double attacks apply a %movement_slow%%% movement slow for %slow_duration% seconds on the first strike. Echo Strike cooldown: %passive_cooldown%s", "notes_en": [], "attributes": ["+ 25 Damage", "+ 25 Strength", "+ 10 Agility", "+ 10 Intelligence", "+ 2.0 Mana Regeneration"], "is_item": true}]
